  "title": "Answer: what is a self",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "61602268-f076-4e58-af64-404fe74fc615",
      "text": "A self is a thing with a Markov blanket that gathers evidence for its own existence. A self-conscious self also models the consequences of its own actions and distinguishes self from other, the self being the deepest hidden cause in that model.",
